### Step 1 — Predict the failing test

| Injected mistake | Expected detector |
| --- | --- |
| Swap conditional true/false state IDs | Differential test exercising both outcomes |
| Return all after a CFG rewrite | Analysis invalidation regression; verify alone may miss it |
